    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey quick question i'm doing my end of year bookkeeping for my freelance design work and i'm stuck on something. i just bought a really expensive ergonomic office chair for my studio setup. does that count as a business expense/deduction or is it considered a personal draw? trying to figure out how to categorize it in quickbooks. thanks",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
