      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "When it comes to deducting an ergonomic office chair for your freelance design work, it generally falls under business expenses. As a self-employed individual or freelancer, you can typically claim business expenses on your tax return, and QuickBooks can help you categorize it accordingly. Set up a line item for \"Office Equipment\" or \"Furniture\" in QuickBooks to deduct the expense, as it's considered a necessary asset for your business setup.",
