      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. and what if i also bought a bunch of smaller things like software subscriptions and some desk accessories? i feel like some of those smaller costs just seem to disappear from my budget and i'm worried i'm missing things or miscalculating the total amount i can claim. like how do i make sure i'm not accidentally losing money on these small deductions?",
