      "content": "yeah i'll definitely keep the receipts. it just feels like there's always these tiny little gaps in my math where a few bucks or ten bucks just go missing. like i'll look at my bank statement and then my records and it's just slightly off and i can't figure out why. do you have any tips for preventing those random little discrepancies from happening? it's driving me crazy that money just seems to vanish sometimes.",
