      "content": "It can be frustrating when discrepancies show up. To minimize these gaps, maintain detailed invoices, receipt tracking, and keep an organized digital or paper record of all financial transactions, including receipts, invoices, and bank statements. Set up automatic reconciliations in QuickBooks to help catch any errors or mismatches, and regularly review your records to ensure they're accurate. This will help you stay on top of your finances and catch those tiny inconsistencies before they add up.",
